  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"infobox vcard\" style=\"width: 22em\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" class=\"n\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 125%\"><span class=\"fn\">Rohan Mustafa</span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/6/6d/Blank_Person.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20150810222433\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/6/6d/Blank_Person.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/265?cb=20150810222433\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"265\" height=\"322\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Blank Person.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Blank_Person.jpg\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:110%;\"><hr /><div style=\"background:lavender;\">39th&#160;Chairman of the Joint Chiefs of Staff</div>\n</th></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"border-bottom:none; text-align:center;\"><b>In&#160;office</b><br />August 1st, 2149&#160;&#8211;&#160;January 20th, 2155\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th>Preceded&#160;by\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Joseph_Loveridge\" title=\"Joseph Loveridge\">Joseph Loveridge</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Succeeded&#160;by\n</th>\n<td>Lin Locke\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr />\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Born\n</th>\n<td>January 26, 2079<br /><a href=\"/wiki/Earth\" title=\"Earth\">Detroit, Michigan, Earth</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th>Nationality\n</th>\n<td>American\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th>Profession\n</th>\n<td>Soldier\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th>Religion\n</th>\n<td>Presbyterian\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #B0C4DE; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;\"><b>Military service</b>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<th>Service/branch\n</th>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/4/42/Flag_of_the_Space_Force.png/revision/latest?cb=20170723143859\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Flag of the Space Force\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/4/42/Flag_of_the_Space_Force.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20170723143859\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Flag of the Space Force.png\" data-image-key=\"Flag_of_the_Space_Force.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span> United States Space Force\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Years&#160;of service\n</th>\n<td>2097-2155\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Rank\n</th>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/4/44/US-O11_Rank.png/revision/latest?cb=20170207175822\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"US-O11 Rank\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/4/44/US-O11_Rank.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20170207175822\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"US-O11 Rank.png\" data-image-key=\"US-O11_Rank.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/United_States_of_America\" title=\"United States of America\">General of the Space Force</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Unit\n</th>\n<td>Planetary Task Force Pacific\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<th>Battles/wars\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Guardiola_Incident\" title=\"Guardiola Incident\">Guardiola Incident</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Belt_Pirate_Wars\" title=\"Belt Pirate Wars\">Belt Pirate Wars</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Third_Mexican-American_War\" title=\"Third Mexican-American War\">Third Mexican War</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</tbody></table>\n<p><b>Rohan Mustafa</b>&#160;(26 January 2079&#160;– present) was an American&#160;five-star&#160;general of the Space Force and&#160;Supreme Commander of Planetary Task Force Pacific during the Third Mexican War. He was&#160;served as Secretary of Defense under Cora Fabian's administration and played a prominent war in organizing the post-war reconstruction of the Americas. He received the&#160;Medal of Honor&#160;for his service in the Texas Campaign, and was one of only three people ever to rise to the rank of&#160;General of the Space Force.\n</p><p>Mustafa was the leading US authority on assault carriers, serving aboard an assault carrier during his early years, and then later was key in the Planetary Guard's adoption of assault carriers designed to engage in combat with large stations that proved essential during the Belt Pirate Wars and the Third Mexican War.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Early_life_and_education\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Early life and education</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Junior_officer\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Junior officer</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Guardiola_Incident\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Guardiola Incident</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Belt_Pirate_Wars\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Belt Pirate Wars</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Third_Mexican_War\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Third Mexican War</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Early_life_and_education\">Early life and education</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FRohan_Mustafa%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=